      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Related: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1643-fallback-avatars-linked-to-an-avatar-as-an-alternative-to-current-user-sele\n\nI feel like that suggestion reflects a better solution than Impostors or Fallbacks alone; for a specific avatar, creators should be able to set (or upload) another avatar as a fallback for a specific avatar. For avatars that don't have these fallbacks set, impostors would be used instead; and if there is no impostor for some reason, I imagine a gray robot of some kind would be used (maybe with the fallback feather on it).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
